flowchart TD
    Start{What's slow?} --> A{App server CPU/mem?}
    A -->|yes| AddSrv[Add web servers behind LB]
    A -->|no| B{DB read latency?}
    B -->|yes| Cache[Add cache layer]
    Cache --> Replica[Then add read replicas]
    B -->|no| C{Static asset latency?}
    C -->|yes| AddCDN[Put assets on CDN]
    C -->|no| D{Sync work blocks requests?}
    D -->|yes| Queue[Introduce message queue]
    D -->|no| E{DB writes saturated?}
    E -->|yes| Shard[Shard the DB]
    E -->|no| F{Single-region SPOF?}
    F -->|yes| MultiDC[Add second DC + GeoDNS]
